error: Claude remote-control is enabled (`[remote_control] claude = true`) but `DISABLE_GROWTHBOOK` in the settings env in /home/dev/.claude/settings.json blocks it.
  - Remove `DISABLE_GROWTHBOOK` from `env` in /home/dev/.claude/settings.json [privacy; RimZ won't change this]
  - Turn claude remote control off for good
      rimz config set remote_control.claude false

  To start with claude remote control off for this run, run `rimz start` in a terminal.
